":{"DMGAmp":"Increases all damage dealt by Yuri by the given %, making it useful for both general damage and higher PVE scores. Also increases DOT damage."},"story":"\"It's alright. Once Evan and Karin are found, we'll all set off on a journey together again — just like the good old days.\"\n\nYuri, a fox who had lived for a thousand years, wandered through all corners of the Asgar and Aisha continents in search of Evan and Karin.\nEven with her cherished companions scattered far and wide, Yuri held onto the hope of reuniting with them as she gazed upon a portrait of the entire Evan Expedition together."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Power Up Dungeon: Earth","cat":"pve","banner":"PU_DUNGEON_EARTH.webp"},{"tip":"Raid: Iron Devourer","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_ID.webp"},{"tip":"Castle Rush: Kris","cat":"pve","banner":"CR_KRIS.webp"},{"tip":"Advent Expedition: Teo","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_TEO.webp"}],"lore":"Yuri is the leader of the three-tailed foxes from Fox's Oasis in the Blazing Desert.\nYuri was once a member of the Shadow Clan, and used her experience dealing with information there to make Fox's Oasis the information trading hub that it is today.\nHowever, Fox's Oasis's rise to fame and wealth also attracted many bad actors.\nThe most notable among them is Leo the lion beastkin, whose many attempts to take over the town made him a constant thorn in Yuri's side.\nAfter Evan's crew helped to get rid of Leo, she joined them on a whim since she was getting bored of watching over Fox's Oasis."}